{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1792786151243208017,"compiled_state":{"alias":"simious-comic-marmot","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"1bf7a71943ec9ce68f905b3a8b411c0faff1c2313290f49c530344770a24da7f","event_uuid":"b64cede5-48b3-48eb-9989-18d1f96ed448","position":{"commit_sha":"8a0acd886fd31220ce1875d403027373a332e044","position":"1792778374460996380-b64cede5-48b3-48eb-9989-18d1f96ed448"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"8d4fc4e1eafa22e34a488df08492b0e256a898fb8c86794f0358e42a1a15a746","event_uuid":"8c561eac-a641-4733-ac66-f7b2c653312d","position":{"commit_sha":"0499d7211993c7ca6b22a2d99413855e959692cb","position":"1792778385235391112-8c561eac-a641-4733-ac66-f7b2c653312d"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1792778374460996380,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"8c561eac-a641-4733-ac66-f7b2c653312d","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"3e32-a859-2153-4a1b"}],"description":"## Observation\nDuring the comment-remediation Group17 full `make verify` run on macOS/Git 2.56, `tests/unit/test_store_commit_maintenance_bd66.py::test_write_survives_foreground_maintenance_repack` failed because the ticket-create `git commit` exceeded its monkeypatched `_GIT_TIMEOUT=1.0`. The same unchanged test passed in 163.96 seconds isolated and again in 44.00 seconds with Git Trace2 under concurrent suites; the latter measured both ticket-create commits at 0.015 seconds each. The Group17 patch changes only comments in other files and preserves normalized AST. At the check, host load averages were 18.13/21.83/22.56, but the failed run has no Git trace, so the cause is unproven.\n\n## Hypotheses and distinguishing check\nCompeting explanations: host scheduling or disk contention delayed a normally short commit; Git or test state occasionally triggers extra work; another changing condition. Run the targeted test with Git Trace2 during controlled low- and high-activity periods, record commit wall time and Git child processes, then determine whether 1 second is a valid stable bound for this invariant. Do not classify a passing retry as a diagnosis.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\nRecord a reproducible cause or a bounded measurement series that distinguishes the explanations; fix the underlying code or the test's timing design without weakening the assertion that commit auto-maintenance is suppressed; run the targeted test under relevant load and the full `make verify` gate. Keep this bug separate from the comment-only Gerrit change.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["bug","flaky-test","testing"],"ticket_id":"99fb-a2f3-3e9d-4116","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Fixed 1-second Git commit bound fails under concurrent full-suite load","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["b64cede5-48b3-48eb-9989-18d1f96ed448","8c561eac-a641-4733-ac66-f7b2c653312d"]},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1792786151243208017,"uuid":"d0fad7ef-07f4-4289-83fe-81587f193e0b"}